{
  "_comment": [
    "One advisory describing four parallel release branches of a single package.",
    "",
    "The advisory is real: GHSA-48r7-hpm6-gfxm, aliased to CVE-2026-54268, copied from the",
    "npm OSV database (all.zip, 2026-07). Its four affected entries all name @angular/common",
    "and carry SEMVER ranges with no versions[] enumeration, so choosing between them needs",
    "version ordering rather than string equality.",
    "",
    "The 19.x branch ends in last_affected with no fixed event at all: there is no fix on that",
    "line. Reading the entries in order returned 22.0.1 to a user on 19.2.17, which is the",
    "defect this fixture exists to prevent.",
    "",
    "The scanner report around them is written by hand; reproducing it would mean depending on",
    "a vulnerable Angular release purely to exercise branch selection."
  ],
